\subsection{Stagnation Mitigation Effects of IIGCR}
We analyzed the average trend of Step Scores across trajectories under the IIGCR method, as illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:refamb_ours_main_step_score_curve_with_baselines}. The results demonstrate that IIGCR effectively mitigates the decline in trajectory activity and, as iterations progress, significantly surpasses the levels observed under both Disturb and Oracle interventions as the iteration proceedings. This indicates that IIGCR not only enhances answer accuracy while alleviating rapid trajectory decay and stagnation, but also underscores that the reduction in trajectory activity reflects an intrinsic behavioral characteristic of the model itself.
